## Changes Made
- `src/state/memory.ts` — Three changes to MemoryStore:
  - `effectiveScore()`: Only episodic memories time-decay (half-life 24h). Procedural and semantic knowledge persist with decay=1.0. Added type weighting (procedural 1.0, semantic 0.85, episodic 0.5). Increased accessBoost coefficient from 0.1 to 0.15.
  - `formatAsMessages()`: Rank by effective score instead of chronological recency. Uses `continue` (not `break`) to pack smaller memories when a large one doesn't fit. Tracks accessCount and lastAccessed on selection, creating a reinforcement feedback loop.
  - `decayEvict()`: Procedural memories with importance >= 0.3 are protected from auto-eviction regardless of score.
- `src/loop/state-machine.ts` — Dynamic memory budget:
  - Renamed `MEMORY_TOKEN_BUDGET` (was 2000) to `BASE_MEMORY_TOKEN_BUDGET` (now 4000).
  - Both `cycle()` and `finalizeCycle()` compute dynamic budget: `BASE + floor(energy.earned / 200)`.
  - Agents that earn more TEQ get larger memory windows — compound interest in knowledge.

